Package: BUDS
Title: BUDS for Two-Stage Single-Arm Phase II Trials
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rebecca", "Irlmeier", role = "aut",
           email = "rirlmeier@miami.edu"),
    person("Zhuoli", "Jin", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zxj285@miami.edu")
    )
Description: Enumerate admissible two-stage designs for phase II clinical
    trials under type-I error and power constraints. Includes classical
    Simon Optimal, Minimax, and Balanced designs for binary endpoints,
    restricted Kwak-Jung (r-KJ) designs for time-to-event endpoints with
    restricted follow-up (Belin et al., 2017), and Benchmark-Uncertainty
    Design Selection (BUDS) criteria. The core search engines are
    implemented in C++ for high performance.
